---
// Renders the contents of a list item with no wrapper element.
//
// The CMS models a list item as `li > lic` (list-item content), and its default
// renderer emits `lic` as a `<div>`. Astro's MDX pipeline puts the text straight
// inside the `<li>`, so without this override every bullet on the site gains a
// block-level div the hand-built pages don't have. Nothing currently styles a
// content `<li>`, so the two render alike today — this keeps them alike, rather
// than leaving a difference for the first `li > *` rule to turn into a bug.
---

<slot />
